nRequired:\n1. **F1 (Tests, Conformance):** add engine checks for the inactive direction, while the level is low:\n   - (a) a Sync receipt timeout, and a grandmaster change, followed by in-band pairs leaves `phc_slew_active_o` low;\n   - (b) a return from grandmaster duty whose first consumed pair is in-band leaves it low.\n\n   Add named mutation controls equivalent to R304-1's R07 and R14 (and any R305-1 equivalents) to `tb/verilator/engine/mutants.py`, each failing its named check.\n2. **F2 (Docs):** refresh the `KL_gptp_engine.sv` anchors in `docs/SOURCE_EVIDENCE.md` to the head layout, and add a row for the slew-level claim. `scripts/static_checks.sh`, or its equivalent, must report every anchor exact.\n\nTaken: R304-1 S1. Record the ROM headroom (1,008 of 1,024 words) and the reserved-prefix packing policy where the next microcode change will see them. Also take R304-1 S2 and R305-1 S1/S2 if cheap.\n\nNo RTL change unless a finding requires one.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/comments/5818374671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/comments/5818850057","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/75#issuecomment-5818850057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/75","id":5818850057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT4nUSs8AAAABWtSbCQ","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api